config BOARD_NXP_SPECIFIC_MPU_SETTINGS
	bool "Board-provided static Arm MPU region table"
	default y if CPU_CORTEX_M7
	help
	  Use the board's static Arm MPU region table instead of the generic
	  SoC fallback. With the Cortex-M7 unmapped-region catch-all enabled,
	  on-chip banks not in the table are unreachable unless an application
	  claims them via a zephyr,memory-attr node. The table only describes
	  the Cortex-M7 memory map, so a board sourcing this file gets it on
	  its Cortex-M7 target only; the choice stays overridable.
